HDSatelit, ramura 5.0 (OE-Alliance 6.0): daca dupa mutarea montarii arhiva imaginii nu se mai vede (de exemplu dosarul de
montare nu s-a putut face), ofgwrite se opreste si reporneste receptorul INAINTE de orice stergere: radacina ramane
intreaga. Pana acum eroarea mutarii se ignora, radacina se stergea, iar tar nu mai gasea arhiva (REGULI-FLASH-RECEPTOR.md,
Regula 1b). Pe 5.0 mesajele merg prin show_error si au traducere; pe master, oprire-fara-arhiva.patch.

--- a/ofgwrite.c
+++ b/ofgwrite.c
@@ -1356,6 +1356,17 @@
 		mount(oldroot_path, rootfs_mount_point, NULL, MS_MOVE, NULL);
 	}

+	// HDSatelit: fara arhiva la locul ei nu se sterge nimic (radacina e inca intreaga): oprire si repornire
+	if (rootfs_filename[0] != '\0' && access(rootfs_filename, R_OK) != 0)
+	{
+		my_printf("Image file not found after moving mountpoint: %s\n", rootfs_filename);
+		show_error(N_("The mounts could not be moved to the flash environment."), N_("Nothing was flashed."),
+			FB_REBOOT, 30);
+		fb_wait(30);
+		reboot(LINUX_REBOOT_CMD_RESTART);
+		return 0;
+	}
+
 	// umount all unneeded filesystems
 	while (mountlist != NULL)
 	{
